{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill confirmed on enemy target.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting an enemy with a skill marks them, causing an inverted triangle indicator to appear. Defeating marked enemies drops resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/fcde77d257cad69a546c48ec08cc7297.poster.avif?t=1757066071\" width=1152 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/fcde77d257cad69a546c48ec08cc7297.webm?t=1757066071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/fcde77d257cad69a546c48ec08cc7297.mp4?t=1757066071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break through special objects in the scene.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying energy orbs in the scene will restore the energy meter; when energy reaches its maximum, the hero transformation skill can be activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/32035f7efdbb540da9712db409db0e3d.poster.avif?t=1757066071\" width=1148 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/32035f7efdbb540da9712db409db0e3d.webm?t=1757066071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528530/extras/32035f7efdbb540da9712db409db0e3d.mp4?t=1757066071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the hero's skill to deal a large amount of damage to enemies in a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span